WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,620
Sister Weiwei, I saw it

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,260
Zhao Ya entered Lin Feng's cave in the middle of the night

3
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,340
Come out just before dawn

4
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:10,010
I also ate chicken legs

5
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,730
Chicken drumsticks at midnight

6
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:14,090
She ate chicken legs while we were pitting fruits.

7
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,450
If she dares to fight with Lin Feng, she must fight first

8
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:19,890
I squatted all night and it was very good

9
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,760
No wonder we are so hungry that we are fierce in front and have backup in reserve

10
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:26,860
She looks better and better every day, Sister Weiwei

11
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,380
Then let’s go and expose her now. There’s no rush.

12
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,110
Empty words

13
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,430
She took a bite

14
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:33,750
Say we wronged people

15
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,870
What should I do if others think of me?

16
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,420
She ate chicken legs

17
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:40,940
There must be some left on hand

18
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,780
Go through Shen Xiaotang's bag

19
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,700
That girl wears the same pants as her

20
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,220
You must hide something and find something to eat

21
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:50,380
can help me turn over what I'm afraid of

22
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:51,700
I asked you to check it

23
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,580
Find out and lend you a job

24
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:55,620
I can't find out. I know the truth.

25
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:56,820
Let me see who dares to touch you
